# ── Rust / Cargo ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock          # only ignore for libraries; binaries should keep it — but fine for mono-repo

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 25 __pycache__ dirs were committed before this was added (2026-07-25); they were
# untracked with `git rm -r --cached` in the same change.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# ── Node / npm ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
dist/
.cache/

# ── Tauri build outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
src-tauri/target/
*.pdb

# ── SQLite databases (runtime data, not source) ───────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.claude\worktrees
# ── Secrets / environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

# ── OS clutter ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Editor / IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.user

# ── Certificates (never commit private keys) ──────────────────────────────────
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
!**/.gitkeep

# ── Docker runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bitwarden-db/
vaultwarden-data/

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
# Bare `logs/` matched ANY directory called "logs" at any depth, which on
# 2026-09-10 silently swallowed a SvelteKit route source directory
# (webapp.v3.Fable/frontend/src/routes/logs/). Git ignored the file, `git add -A`
# skipped it without comment, CI built an app without that page, and the deployed
# site 404'd on /logs while every local check passed — the failure only existed in
# the gap between the two. Anchored to the repo root so it means runtime log
# directories, which is all it was ever for; source is never ignored by accident.
/logs/
/**/node_modules/logs/

# ── DLSS 5 injector skill (789 MB of mod binaries — keep out of git history) ──
homelab/agentic/skills/dlss5-injector/

.claude

# Agent bridge runtime state (Dungine): queue db, envelopes, artifacts, logs. Never commit.
.agent-state/
homelab/DND.vbeta/tools/pilot-scratch/
